              <p align="left"><font size="2"><b><u>What you need:</u></b> In order 
                to <i>even</i> be considered for joining our ranks, and wearing 
                the DV tag, you will be required to be level <b>46</b>. In addition 
                to this, the prequisite to guilding will mean that you have to 
                own both your <b>Cobalt Scar Tooth</b>, and your <b>Sebelis Key</b>.<br>
                <br>
                <b>Dark Vigilance</b> is glad to see that you are interested in 
                joining our ranks. To continue on to the actual application page, 
